2025-10-08 12:27:11,657 [WARNING] Skipped idx=525: gold or llm supporting sentence is empty. gold='', llm='The p73 gene, which encodes the p73 tumor suppressor, is expressed as two main isoforms: TAp73 and ΔNp73. TAp73 is the full-length isoform that has been shown to have similar activity to p53 and functions as a tumor suppressor. ΔNp73, on the other hand, is a truncated isoform that lacks the first 53 amino acids and has both pro- and anti-survival functions. It is important to note that while the p73 gene itself is rarely mutated in spontaneous tumors, the expression status of p73, particularly TAp73, is linked to the sensitivity of tumor cells to chemotherapy and prognosis in many types of human cancer. This makes the regulation of p73, including its degradation by E3 ubiquitin ligases like Pirh2, a subject of significant interest in cancer research.'
